1093:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_function.h ****    *  returns `f(x)`.  The functor `pointer_to_binary_function` does the same
1094:D:/Program Files/msys64/mingw64/arm-none-eabi/include/c++/13.3.0/bits\stl_function.h ****    *  thing, but with a double-argument `f` and `operator()`.
